The files in this folder (src/lib/engine/katago/) are a port of the KataGo engine of Web KaTrain
(https://github.com/Sir-Teo/web-katrain, src/engine/katago/ and the AI strategies of
src/store/gameStore.ts), source commit a6a67d645048a996d606a410c4e4c4b1051ffd43 (2026-10-28),
which itself reimplements parts of KataGo (https://github.com/lightvector/KataGo: the network
format, the v7 input features, the search and its parameters) and of KaTrain
(https://github.com/sanderland/katrain: the calibrated-rank strategy). Zigo's changes are covered
by Zigo's MIT licence (see the repository's LICENSE).

The KataGo networks Zigo runs (public/engine/nets/) are CC0; see public/engine/nets/README.md.

